{"id":"f5f5f61df0b23b90","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/081_超相继式演算_Hypersequents.md","title":"081 超相继式演算","display":"081_超相继式演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-公式语言\">1. 公式语言</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"atm,\\quad bot,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[atm,\\quad bot,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_H\">\\(Frm_H\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop\">\\(p\\in Prop\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm(p)\\in Frm_H\">\\(atm(p)\\in Frm_H\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bot\\in Frm_H\">\\(bot\\in Frm_H\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_H\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_H\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)\\in Frm_H\">\\(and(A,B)\\in Frm_H\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_H\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_H\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\in Frm_H\">\\(or(A,B)\\in Frm_H\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_H\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_H\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_H\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_H\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>本系统的目标差异为：证明对象在超相继式多重集层面操作，并包含外部弱化、外部收缩和通信规则；它不是单个相继式演算。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式操作\">2. 公式操作</h1>\n<p>变元函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV(bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV(bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\n\\quad\nPV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\n\\quad\nPV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_H=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_H\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_H=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_H\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>命题替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in Sub_H\">\\(\\sigma\\in Sub_H\\)</span> 的扩张满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(bot)=bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(bot)=bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(or(A,B))=or(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(imp(A,B))=imp(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(imp(A,B))=imp(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-相继式与超相继式\">3. 相继式与超相继式</h1>\n<p>单个相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Seq_H=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H)\\times\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Seq_H=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H)\\times\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\)</span>。超相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"HSeq=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Seq_H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[HSeq=\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Seq_H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_0\\mid\\cdots\\mid S_{n-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_0\\mid\\cdots\\mid S_{n-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>超相继式上下文是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"HSeq\">\\(HSeq\\)</span> 中带一个洞的有限多重集，填洞记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[S]\">\\(G[S]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>形式化地，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"HCtx=HSeq\\times HSeq,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[HCtx=HSeq\\times HSeq,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_H((G_0,G_1),S)=G_0\\mid S\\mid G_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_H((G_0,G_1),S)=G_0\\mid S\\mid G_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[S]\">\\(G[S]\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Plug_H(G,S)\">\\(Plug_H(G,S)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-初始超相继式\">4. 初始超相继式</h1>\n<p>初始关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_H\n=\n\\{G[\\Gamma,atm(p)\\Rightarrow atm(p),\\Delta]:\nG\\in HCtx,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H),\\ p\\in Prop\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_H\n=\n\\{G[\\Gamma,atm(p)\\Rightarrow atm(p),\\Delta]:\nG\\in HCtx,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H),\\ p\\in Prop\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_H=Init_H\\cup\\{G[\\Gamma,bot\\Rightarrow\\Delta]:G\\in HCtx,\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_H=Init_H\\cup\\{G[\\Gamma,bot\\Rightarrow\\Delta]:G\\in HCtx,\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_H\">\\(Ax_H\\)</span> 已把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[\\Gamma,bot\\Rightarrow\\Delta]\">\\(G[\\Gamma,bot\\Rightarrow\\Delta]\\)</span> 收为初始叶，本系统不再重复设置零前提 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\bot L}^{H}\">\\(Rule_{\\bot L}^{H}\\)</span>；底左实例统一由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_H\">\\(Ax_H\\)</span> 的叶节点分支接入证明树。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-内部逻辑规则\">5. 内部逻辑规则</h1>\n<p>本节全部规则参数统一量化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_H,\n\\qquad\nG\\in HCtx,\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in Frm_H,\n\\qquad\nG\\in HCtx,\n\\qquad\n\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Pi,\\Lambda\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个显示的一元或二元前提组均按有限前提列解释，因此规则属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"HSeq^{&lt;\\omega}\\times HSeq\">\\(HSeq^{&lt;\\omega}\\times HSeq\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>内部合取规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge L}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G[\\Gamma,A,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta],G[\\Gamma,and(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta])\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge L}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G[\\Gamma,A,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta],G[\\Gamma,and(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta])\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\wedge R}^{H}\n=\n\\{((G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta],G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta]),\nG[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow and(A,B),\\Delta])\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\wedge R}^{H}\n=\n\\{((G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta],G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta]),\nG[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow and(A,B),\\Delta])\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>内部析取规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee L}^{H}\n=\n\\{((G[\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta],G[\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta]),\nG[\\Gamma,or(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta])\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee L}^{H}\n=\n\\{((G[\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow\\Delta],G[\\Gamma,B\\Rightarrow\\Delta]),\nG[\\Gamma,or(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta])\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\vee R}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,B,\\Delta],G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B),\\Delta])\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\vee R}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,B,\\Delta],G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow or(A,B),\\Delta])\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>内部蕴含规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to L}^{H}\n=\n\\{((G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta],G[\\Pi,B\\Rightarrow\\Lambda]),\nG[\\Gamma,\\Pi,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Lambda])\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\to L}^{H}\n=\n\\{((G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A,\\Delta],G[\\Pi,B\\Rightarrow\\Lambda]),\nG[\\Gamma,\\Pi,imp(A,B)\\Rightarrow\\Delta,\\Lambda])\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{\\to R}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G[\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta],G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow imp(A,B),\\Delta])\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{\\to R}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G[\\Gamma,A\\Rightarrow B,\\Delta],G[\\Gamma\\Rightarrow imp(A,B),\\Delta])\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-外部结构规则与通信\">6. 外部结构规则与通信</h1>\n<p>本节统一量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in HSeq\">\\(G\\in HSeq\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in Seq_H\">\\(S\\in Seq_H\\)</span>，并在通信规则中量化\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Pi,\\Delta,\\Lambda,\\Theta,\\Xi\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H)\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Pi,\\Delta,\\Lambda,\\Theta,\\Xi\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H)\\)</span>；这些声明覆盖所有未在集合式右侧重复出现的自由参数。</p>\n<p>外部弱化为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{EW}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G,G\\mid S):S\\in Seq_H\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{EW}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G,G\\mid S):S\\in Seq_H\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>外部收缩为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{EC}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G\\mid S\\mid S,G\\mid S):S\\in Seq_H\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{EC}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G\\mid S\\mid S,G\\mid S):S\\in Seq_H\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>通信规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{Com}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G\\mid \\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\mid\\Lambda,\\Theta\\Rightarrow\\Xi,\nG\\mid \\Gamma,\\Theta\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\mid\\Lambda,\\Pi\\Rightarrow\\Xi):\nG\\in HSeq,\\ \\Gamma,\\Pi,\\Delta,\\Lambda,\\Theta,\\Xi\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{Com}^{H}\n=\n\\{(G\\mid \\Gamma,\\Pi\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\mid\\Lambda,\\Theta\\Rightarrow\\Xi,\nG\\mid \\Gamma,\\Theta\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\mid\\Lambda,\\Pi\\Rightarrow\\Xi):\nG\\in HSeq,\\ \\Gamma,\\Pi,\\Delta,\\Lambda,\\Theta,\\Xi\\in\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Frm_H)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该通信规则是超相继式层面的目标特征；它不是单个相继式内部规则。</p>\n<p>定义总规则关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_H=\nRule_{\\wedge L}^{H}\\cup Rule_{\\wedge R}^{H}\n\\cup Rule_{\\vee L}^{H}\\cup Rule_{\\vee R}^{H}\n\\cup Rule_{\\to L}^{H}\\cup Rule_{\\to R}^{H}\n\\cup Rule_{EW}^{H}\\cup Rule_{EC}^{H}\\cup Rule_{Com}^{H}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_H=\nRule_{\\wedge L}^{H}\\cup Rule_{\\wedge R}^{H}\n\\cup Rule_{\\vee L}^{H}\\cup Rule_{\\vee R}^{H}\n\\cup Rule_{\\to L}^{H}\\cup Rule_{\\to R}^{H}\n\\cup Rule_{EW}^{H}\\cup Rule_{EC}^{H}\\cup Rule_{Com}^{H}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-超相继式推导树\">7. 超相继式推导树</h1>\n<p>超相继式推导树由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{H}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}_{H}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{H}\">\\(\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{H}\\)</span> 刻画。</p>\n<p>定义有限路径、根树、子节点和叶节点：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(k&gt;0\\land q:k\\to\\{u,v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec)\n\\land q(0)=u\\land q(k-1)=v\n\\land \\forall i+1&lt;k\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\land r\\in N\n\\land \\forall n\\in N\\,\\exists!q\\,\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec}(q,r,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\prec)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\prec):n\\prec m\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\Longleftrightarrow \\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N\\to HSeq.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tree}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nN\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\\land r\\in N\\land\n\\operatorname{RootedTree}(N,r,\\prec)\\land \\lambda:N\\to HSeq.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{H}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Ax_H)\n\\lor\n\\exists m\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_H)\n\\lor\n\\exists m_0,m_1\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m_0,m_1\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m_0),\\lambda(m_1)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{H}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec}(n)\\land\\lambda(n)\\in Ax_H)\n\\lor\n\\exists m\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_H)\n\\lor\n\\exists m_0,m_1\\,(\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec}(n)=\\{m_0,m_1\\}\\land ((\\lambda(m_0),\\lambda(m_1)),\\lambda(n))\\in Rule_H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{H}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Der}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall n\\in N\\ \\operatorname{NodeOK}_{H}(N,\\prec,\\lambda,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系\">8. 可导关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_H G\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=G\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_H G\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\land\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=G\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RootLab}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{HSeq}=\\{G\\in HSeq:\\vdash_H G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RootLab}_{H}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)=\\lambda(r),\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{HSeq}=\\{G\\in HSeq:\\vdash_H G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{HSeq}=(HSeq,HCtx,Plug_H,Rule_{EW}^{H},Rule_{EC}^{H},Rule_{Com}^{H},\\operatorname{Der}_{H},\\mathsf{Cn}_{HSeq}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{HSeq}=(HSeq,HCtx,Plug_H,Rule_{EW}^{H},Rule_{EC}^{H},Rule_{Com}^{H},\\operatorname{Der}_{H},\\mathsf{Cn}_{HSeq}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Hypersequent}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_H,\nPV,\nSub_H,\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nSeq_H,\nHSeq,\nHCtx,\nPlug_H,\nInit_H,\nAx_H,\nRule_{\\wedge L}^{H},\nRule_{\\wedge R}^{H},\nRule_{\\vee L}^{H},\nRule_{\\vee R}^{H},\nRule_{\\to L}^{H},\nRule_{\\to R}^{H},\nRule_{EW}^{H},\nRule_{EC}^{H},\nRule_{Com}^{H},\nRule_H,\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{H},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{H},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{H},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{H},\n\\vdash_H,\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{HSeq},\n\\Delta_{HSeq}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Hypersequent}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_H,\nPV,\nSub_H,\n\\widehat\\sigma,\nSeq_H,\nHSeq,\nHCtx,\nPlug_H,\nInit_H,\nAx_H,\nRule_{\\wedge L}^{H},\nRule_{\\wedge R}^{H},\nRule_{\\vee L}^{H},\nRule_{\\vee R}^{H},\nRule_{\\to L}^{H},\nRule_{\\to R}^{H},\nRule_{EW}^{H},\nRule_{EC}^{H},\nRule_{Com}^{H},\nRule_H,\n\\operatorname{Path}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{RootedTree},\n\\operatorname{ch}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{leaf}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Tree}_{H},\n\\operatorname{NodeOK}_{H},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{H},\n\\operatorname{RootLab}_{H},\n\\vdash_H,\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{HSeq},\n\\Delta_{HSeq}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含超相继式多重集、内部逻辑规则、外部结构规则和通信规则；不含嵌套括号结构、标号关系原子、割规则或结构解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-公式语言","text":"1. 公式语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式操作","text":"2. 公式操作","level":1},{"id":"3.-相继式与超相继式","text":"3. 相继式与超相继式","level":1},{"id":"4.-初始超相继式","text":"4. 初始超相继式","level":1},{"id":"5.-内部逻辑规则","text":"5. 内部逻辑规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-外部结构规则与通信","text":"6. 外部结构规则与通信","level":1},{"id":"7.-超相继式推导树","text":"7. 超相继式推导树","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系","text":"8. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"atm,\\quad bot,\\quad and,\\quad or,\\quad imp.","display":true},{"tex":"Frm_H","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Prop","display":false},{"tex":"atm(p)\\in Frm_H","display":false},{"tex":"bot\\in Frm_H","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_H","display":false},{"tex":"and(A,B)\\in Frm_H","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_H","display":false},{"tex":"or(A,B)\\in Frm_H","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_H","display":false},{"tex":"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_H","display":false},{"tex":"PV(atm(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad PV(bot)=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"PV(and(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),\n\\quad\nPV(or(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B),","display":true},{"tex":"PV(imp(A,B))=PV(A)\\cup PV(B).","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_H=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_H\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in Sub_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(atm(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(bot)=bot,","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma(and(A,B))=and(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),","display